# Local modules

Modules used only by this deployment. Each directory is a self-contained module
(`main.tf`, `variables.tf`, `outputs.tf`, `versions.tf`) called from `../main.tf` with
`source = "./modules/<name>"`.

Promote a module to its own repository (and pin it by tag) once a second deployment needs it.

Modules declare `required_providers` but never a `provider` block; providers are configured
once, in the root `versions.tf`.
